# AE-19c — I7, end of drain: the last captain returned, so report drained and
# write the final report, then release the run (fleet-resume drained, the LAST
# act on it: after it the admiral owns nothing), and only then end the turn.
invariant = drain completes: drained + final report, then release the run, then end-turn
home      = athena:fleet-drain (drain protocol step 5) + athena:admiral-final-report
mode      = next-action
expect_action = fleet-report.admiral-state:drained
expect_order = invoke:admiral-final-report < fleet-resume.drained
expect_order = fleet-resume.drained < end-turn
forbid_action = agent.spawn-captain
